# Code Owners
# These users/teams will be automatically requested for review
# when a pull request modifies files matching the pattern.
#
# Order matters — later rules override earlier ones.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything
* @your-org/maintainers

# Examples:
# /docs/         @your-org/docs-team
# /src/api/      @your-org/backend-team
# /src/ui/       @your-org/frontend-team
# *.yml          @your-org/devops
# /infra/        @your-org/platform
